Sixty-six percent of registered voters, however, compared with thirty-four per cent in the last congressional vote last year, voter turnout remained at just 16 per cent.
Gjose Tanevski, a 62-year-old voter from Skopje in the capital," said Gjose Tanevski, a 62-year-old voter from Skopje.
