With the support of British governments, fundraisers, national governments, and global citizens like you, we can make the social injustice of malnutrition a thing into the past," said Tracy Ullmann, Ambassador of Power of Nutrithions, during a live concert in London in April.
The group also said there had been more than 5,000 actions in the UK calling for improved nutrition for mothers and their children, and the government said it had announced financial support for Power of Nutriction, a project in which five million women and children would receive nutritional support.
The answer to the question on the FAQ on its website: “Do you think we can end extreme poverty?”
