Dessert Island disc: Tom Daley felt "inferiority" about sexuality
Tom Daley, an Olympic diver, has grown while feeling that he is inferior to others in terms of sexuality, but that motivated him to succeed.
A twenty-four-year-old boy didn’t realize until he went to junior high school that “I’m different from the kids around me.”
